{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "公", "id": "公"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "告", "id": "吿"}, {"form": "宿", "id": "宿"}, {"form": "昔", "id": "昔"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "為", "id": "爲"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "美", "id": "美"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.6451379613735847, "source": "反", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.417726683613366, "source": "反", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.7245795030534206, "source": "反", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.031432322493475, "source": "反", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 0.9899784476653143, "source": "行", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 1.1151415906193203, "source": "行", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 3.82319179172153, "source": "行", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.4368974306016398, "source": "行", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 0.13431233760759406, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.6451379613735847, "source": "人", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.6451379613735847, "source": "人", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 0.3574558889218038, "source": "人", "target": "昔"}, {"weight": 0.4219944100593749, "source": "昔", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.6259672143853108, "source": "昔", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 0.8919980393051105, "source": "仁", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 3.6000482404073204, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.21375387928743, "source": "仁", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.4599820769110496, "source": "仁", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 2.9069010598473755, "source": "仁